WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.580
Welcome to NON-QM

00:00:01.580 --> 00:00:01.920
Nexus.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:03.620
In two minutes, I'll

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:04.100
show you how to

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.900
enter a scenario,

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.580
review results, and find

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:07.600
the right programs and

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.020
documents.

00:00:08.640 --> 00:00:09.740
Start with voice scenario.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:10.980
Tap the microphone and

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:12.000
describe the deal naturally.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:12.880
For example,

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:14.040
purchase of an $800

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.620
,000 primary residence with

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:16.500
20 % down.

00:00:17.140 --> 00:00:18.320
It's a single family

00:00:18.320 --> 00:00:18.600
home.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:19.700
The borrower has a

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.480
740 FICO, uses 12

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.720
-month business bank statements

00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:23.840
and is a U

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:23.940
.S.

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:24.360
citizen.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.300
Nexus captures purpose, occupancy,

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:27.820
property type, value,

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:29.420
loan amount, LTV,

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.320
credit, income type, and

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:31.840
citizenship.

00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.600
Review every value and

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:34.880
correct anything misheard.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:36.360
If information is missing,

00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:37.740
Nexus asks for it.

00:00:38.120 --> 00:00:38.920
You can also type.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:40.680
When complete, Nexus ranks

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:41.980
the strongest lender matches

00:00:41.980 --> 00:00:42.360
first.

00:00:42.900 --> 00:00:43.640
Open a match to

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:44.860
review its score, terms,

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.320
reasons, and conditions.

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:47.400
The score is a

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.900
preliminary fit score, not

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:49.500
a loan approval.

00:00:49.640 --> 00:00:50.880
Open the scenario -specific

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:52.680
document needs list, required

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.480
items appear first, and

00:00:54.480 --> 00:00:55.800
view full document list

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:57.200
opens the complete checklist.

00:00:57.660 --> 00:00:58.540
For a standing reference,

00:00:58.860 --> 00:00:59.940
open doc checklists.

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:01.960
Choose bank statement, P

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.560
and L only, DSCR,

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:06.520
asset depletion, or another

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:07.060
loan type.

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:08.860
Toggle between purchase and

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:09.560
refinance.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.120
And the required documents

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.200
update immediately.

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:13.160
For P and L

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.100
only, the P and

00:01:14.100 --> 00:01:14.800
L statement is the

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:15.600
income document.

00:01:15.920 --> 00:01:17.020
Tax returns are not

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:17.520
required.

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.560
Unique NON-QM products

00:01:19.560 --> 00:01:20.680
helps you discover rare

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:22.360
programs offered by one

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.360
or only a few

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:23.700
lenders.

00:01:23.940 --> 00:01:26.320
Explore jumbo AUS, ITIN,

00:01:26.620 --> 00:01:28.260
DSCR, ITIN, P and

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:29.480
L only, and doctor

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:31.020
or medical professional loans.

00:01:31.380 --> 00:01:32.880
Compare standout features and

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:34.280
current matrix reminders for

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.480
special borrower circumstance.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.140
Finally, open lenders.

00:01:37.580 --> 00:01:38.700
The verified directory is

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.100
alphabetical, and every card

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.080
shows the lender's number

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:42.360
of NON-QM programs.

00:01:42.860 --> 00:01:43.820
Search by name or

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:44.620
select a lender to

00:01:44.620 --> 00:01:46.580
review programs, maximum LTV,

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:47.900
minimum FICO,

00:01:48.460 --> 00:01:49.640
loan amounts, reserves,

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:51.180
guideline dates, notes,

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:52.460
and source citations.

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:53.900
For deal -specific rankings,

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:54.940
return to the scenario

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:55.280
results.

